  RELEVANCE: This is the most comprehensive recent scholarly treatment of Kautsky's theoretical system and its relation to Marx's own political economy. It situates Kautsky's political theory of history within his broader account of capitalist development, showing how determinist premises generate reformist-revolutionary conclusions.

  POSITION: Sympathetic but critical reconstruction of Kautsky's Marxism as a coherent system, emphasising continuities with and divergences from Marx.
  },
