  RELEVANCE: One of the most analytically precise treatments of the three-way polemic, showing how divergent philosophies of revolutionary history -- not merely tactical disagreements -- ground the debate about the dictatorship of the proletariat. Directly relevant to the project's interest in how Kautsky's historiosophy generates specific political commitments.

  POSITION: Kautsky's critique of Bolshevism as philosophically grounded rather than merely reformist timidity.
  },
